## Architecture — 4-Layer (Strict)

```
src/
├── routes/                   # Layer 1: HTTP Transport
│   ├── {{ lower (index .Entities 0) }}.routes.js
│   └── health.routes.js
├── controllers/              # Layer 2: Orchestration (coord. services)
{{ range .Entities }}│   ├── {{ lower . }}.controller.js
{{ end }}├── services/                 # Layer 3: Business logic
{{ range .Entities }}│   ├── {{ lower . }}.service.js
{{ end }}├── repositories/             # Layer 4: Database access (Prisma)
{{ range .Entities }}│   ├── {{ lower . }}.repository.js
{{ end }}├── domain/                   # Interfaces + DTOs
│   └── types.js
└── infrastructure/           # External adapters
    ├── database.js           # Prisma client
{{ if .HasRedis }}    ├── cache.js              # Redis client
{{ end }}{{ if .HasRabbitMQ }}    └── queue.js              # RabbitMQ connection
{{ end }}
```

