## Agents

Use `claude --agent <name>` to invoke a specialized agent.

| Agent | Model | Role |
|-------|-------|------|
| `developer` | opus | Node.js/Express engineer — implements features, fixes bugs |
| `tester` | sonnet | QA engineer — writes Jest tests, validates implementations |
| `reviewer` | sonnet | Adversarial reviewer — read-only code review, quality gate |
| `strategist` | opus | Product strategist and architecture advisor — research, design decisions, ADRs |
| `manager` | opus | Orchestrator — breaks tasks, spawns strategist/dev/test/review pipeline |

## Skills

| Skill | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `/continue` | Resume previous session — reads context, picks up work |
| `/commit` | Smart commit — runs test/lint, conventional commit format |

