## Rules

- Pino for ALL logging — no console.log in production code
- Errors use custom AppError class with HTTP status codes
- Prisma for ALL database access — no raw SQL
- Constructor-based DI — no singletons in business logic
- Files under 300 lines
- No hardcoded secrets — environment variables only
